  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> for which the sum of cubes of the roots of the equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> attains its minimum value is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
