  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be the roots,<br />Then,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dd733f7b-672b-4372-90a0-e61ad25831e5.png\" style=\"width:1.88681in;height:1.16042in\" /><br />Thus, <math><mi>E</mi></math> attains its minimum value at <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
